---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import CtaBand from '../components/CtaBand.astro';
import { contact, site } from '../data/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Shravonix — Engineering-led CCTV, Anand & Nadiad"
  description="Shravonix is an engineering-led CCTV dealership and integrator based in Anand and Nadiad, Gujarat — surveillance designed with the same discipline as the infrastructure it watches."
>
  <section class="border-b border-[var(--seam)]">
    <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-10 px-4 py-14 sm:px-6 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:py-20">
      <div class="lg:col-span-7">
        <h1 class="display text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-[3.4rem]">
          Signal <span class="text-[var(--blue-deep)]">over</span> noise.
        </h1>
        <p class="measure mt-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-[var(--ink-mid)]">
          Shravonix started as an engineering habit, not a shop counter. Our founder spent years keeping servers and
          networks alive professionally — and kept meeting businesses whose CCTV had been sold to them, not designed
          for them: wrong lenses, overfull drives, cables nobody could trace, footage that arrived after the incident
          stopped mattering.
        </p>
        <p class="measure mt-4 text-[var(--ink-mid)]">
          So we turned the discipline around: survey before quote, design before purchase, documentation at handover,
          and maintenance that treats a fogged lens as the emergency it is. We are based in {contact.cities.join(' and ')} and
          work across Gujarat — close enough to be on site fast, and accountable in person.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="lg:col-span-5">
        <div class="plate bolted p-7">
          <h2 class="data text-[var(--ink-low)]">What we are</h2>
          <ul class="mt-4 space-y-3.5 text-sm text-[var(--ink-mid)]">
            <li class="flex gap-3">
              <Icon name="cctv" class="mt-0.5 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-[var(--blue-deep)]" />
              <span><strong class="text-[var(--ink)]">A CCTV dealership</strong> — genuine hardware across bullet, dome, PTZ and recording lines.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex gap-3">
              <Icon name="shield" class="mt-0.5 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-[var(--blue-deep)]" />
              <span><strong class="text-[var(--ink)]">A systems integrator</strong> — the survey, the design drawing, the installation, the handover file.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex gap-3">
              <Icon name="wrench" class="mt-0.5 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-[var(--blue-deep)]" />
              <span><strong class="text-[var(--ink)]">A maintenance partner</strong> — AMC contracts that keep systems proven, patched and watched.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex gap-3">
              <Icon name="pin" class="mt-0.5 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-[var(--blue-deep)]" />
              <span><strong class="text-[var(--ink)]">Local</strong> — {contact.cities.join(' & ')} based, Gujarat covered, faces you can hold to the work.</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-b border-[var(--seam)] bg-[var(--card)]">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-14 sm:px-6 lg:py-20">
      <h2 class="subdisplay reveal text-3xl">How we work</h2>
      <div class="reveal mt-8 grid gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-[var(--seam)] bg-[var(--seam)] sm:grid-cols-3">
        {
          [
            ['Honest specs', 'We quote against a drawing, not a mood. If a cheaper camera meets your need, that is the one in the BoM.'],
            ['Documented everything', 'Camera maps, credentials, cable schedules, warranties — handed over, so you own your system outright.'],
            ['Footage that answers', 'Every camera earns its position. If a placement cannot say what it is for, it does not get drilled.'],
          ].map(([t, b]) => (
            <div class="bg-[var(--paper)] p-6 lg:p-7">
              <h3 class="subdisplay text-lg">{t}</h3>
              <p class="mt-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[var(--ink-mid)]">{b}</p>
            </div>
          ))
        }
      </div>
      <p class="reveal mt-8 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-[var(--ink-low)]">
        {site.tagline} It is not a slogan we picked for the wall — it is the difference between a system someone sold
        you and a system someone engineered.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CtaBand />
</BaseLayout>
